# Warnings at the bottom of the Command menu.
# At most two show at once, in this order: not_enough_food, no_guard, too_many_gardeners.
# Values you can use: {{food}} (food now), {{projected}} (food after tonight),
# {{gardeners}} (people set to Garden), {{plots}} (garden plots).
# Keep each warning short: one line, about 40 characters.
# Write a colon as \: (a plain "word:" at the start would be read as a speaker's name).

~ not_enough_food
Not everyone is guaranteed to be fed!
=> END

~ no_guard
No guard\: strangers might sneak into the compound!
=> END

~ too_many_gardeners
Only {{plots}} plots on the farm\: extra hands won't help!
=> END
